# 
# API Smoke Tests – Better Auth 
#  
# What this file is for:
#   - Quick sanity checks for the auth server and session-based authentication.
#   - A repeatable “happy path” flow: Health → Login → Session → Logout.
#   - Uses REST Client’s cookie jar to persist the Better Auth session cookie between requests.
#  
#  How to use:
#   1) Run “Health Check” to confirm the server is up.
#   2) Run “Login” (expects 200 + Set-Cookie).
#   3) Run “Session” to confirm you are authenticated.
#   4) Run “Logout” to clear the session.
#  
#   Important:
#   - Better Auth enforces Origin/CSRF checks, so every auth request includes:
#       Origin: {{origin}}
#       Referer: {{origin}}/
#   - Keep {{baseUrl}} and {{origin}} aligned with your actual dev ports.
#   - Use the same host consistently (localhost vs 127.0.0.1) or cookies won’t match.
#  
#  Variables:
#   - @baseUrl: backend/auth server base URL
#   - @origin: frontend origin allowed by Better Auth (trusted origin)
#   - @cookieJar: name of the cookie jar used by REST Client
#  
#   @see http://localhost:3001/auth/docs
#  


@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001
@origin = http://localhost:3000
@cookieJar = betterauth
@authPrefix = auth


### Health Check - Is the server running? - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/ok

### Login - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/sign-in/email
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "email": "dev@test.com",
  "password": "developer123",
  "callbackURL": "",
  "rememberMe": true
}


### Session (proof you’re logged in) - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/get-session
Origin: {{origin}}


### Logout - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/sign-out
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{}


### All Organizations - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/organization/list
Origin: {{origin}}
Referer: {{origin}}/


### Create Organization - ok
# The user id of the organization creator. If not provided, the current user will be used.
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/organization/create
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "name": "Test Organization 2",
  "slug": "test-org-2",
  # "userId": "",
  # "logo": "",
  # "metadata": "",
  "keepCurrentActiveOrganization": true
}


### Get Active Organization - ok
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/organization/get-full-organization
Origin: {{origin}}


### Set Active Organization - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/organization/set-active
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  # Can be null to unset the active organization
  "organizationId": "ysMQ1D8z0sFLhbLFBCy8kz3Xc6vO3Vsu"
}


### Update Organization - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/organization/update
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "data": {
    "name": "Test Organization 1 Updated",
    "slug": "test-org-1-updated",
    "logo": "",
    "metadata": {}
  },
  "organizationId": "ysMQ1D8z0sFLhbLFBCy8kz3Xc6vO3Vsu"
}


### Delete Organization - ok
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{authPrefix}}/organization/delete
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{
  "organizationId": "G1J3xiNwVX4ZjV8jxWynnIjBa16UEmIy"
}
